title: Analytics › Case summary panel
route: /analytics
intro: One payer decision in plain words, opened from a case table row. It shows who and what was asked, what the payer decided and why, what was done about it, and a short neutral timeline. Initials and age only.
dir: TD
also: Most cases are past cases with no page in the demo. The real ones link to their pages: the open denials (for example D-3318, D-3297, D-3306) and the approvals behind the Case Manager ledger. R-1042's earlier intensive outpatient authorization opens R-1042.
---
start s1 "Click a row in a case table (payer panel or case list panel)"
overlay o1 "Panel on top of the others: case id, initials and age, payer\nButton 'Copy summary'"
screen a1 "Outcome: 'Approved as requested', 'Approved in part' or 'Denied'\n'7 of 14 days approved' with a bar\nThe reason and a tag 'Preventable' or 'Not preventable', with one sentence on what that means"
screen a2 "Facts: payer, program, request type, diagnosis group, population, site, decided date, time to decision, CMS decision time (within it, past it, or not applicable), more information asked or not"
screen a3 "'What was done': peer-to-peer (no call, booked, changed the decision, stood), appeal (none, filed, overturned, partly restored, upheld), accepted or not"
screen a4 "'Timeline': request sent, information requested, decision, peer-to-peer, appeal, accepted, each with a date"
decision q1 "Does the case exist in the demo?"
click c1 "Click 'Open case'"
goto g1 "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Ways in"
click c2 "Click 'Open the denial' (a denial that is in Denial Intelligence)"
goto g2 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › Open denials list"
screen n1 "'A past case: it has no page in this demo.' No link"
click b1 "Click 'Copy summary'"
process b2 "Copies the case lines\nToast 'Case summary copied'\nMarked as demo data"
input k1 "Press Escape"
process k2 "Closes this layer only\nThe panel below stays"
end e1 "Back on the list or the payer panel"

s1 --> o1 --> a1 --> a2 --> a3 --> a4 --> q1
q1 -->|Yes| c1 --> g1
q1 -->|Yes| c2 --> g2
q1 -->|No| n1
o1 --> b1 --> b2
o1 --> k1 --> k2 --> e1
